# Added 2026-09-03 — discovered missing entirely during the platform-module-lifecycle branch's
# live verification: `platform module install`'s new require_clean_worktree guard (repo.py — the
# first platform-cli command that refuses to run against ANY uncommitted change, including
# untracked files, not just modified ones) tripped on __pycache__ directories left over from
# `pip install`/`pytest` runs, which had nowhere to be ignored because this repo never had a root
# .gitignore at all. Confirmed via `git ls-files | grep -E "__pycache__|\.pytest_cache|..."` that
# nothing junky was ever actually committed — this is purely "add the missing file," not a cleanup
# of already-tracked cruft (a .gitignore can't retroactively un-track something already committed
# anyway; `git rm --cached` would be the tool for that, not needed here).

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Secrets / local config — never commit these
*.env
.env.*
bootstrap/.env
kubeconfig*
*.kubeconfig
sealed-secrets-private-key.yaml

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Helm
charts/**/charts/
charts/**/*.tgz

# Node / ui-shell (feature/ui-shell-scaffold, 2026-09-04) — .env.local and friends are already
# covered by the .env.* pattern above, not duplicated here.
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
.vite/
